fix: sync achievements between Flutter and web (#7)

Push: compute all currently-unlocked achievement IDs from local prefs
(word count, streak, XP, SRS mastered, boolean flags, level-test flags)
and upsert to achievements table with ignoreDuplicates=true so the table
is append-only — a reset streak never removes an earned badge.

Pull: read cloud achievement IDs and set the local boolean/level flags
for activity-based achievements (quiz_first, quiz_perfect, flashcard_first,
srs_first, a1/a2/b1_complete). Derived achievements are recomputed from
already-synced underlying data on every screen load, so no extra flag needed.
